    <string name="format_desc_png">PNG: lossless, but about 20 MB per photo and a little slower to save.</string>
    <string name="format_desc_raw">RAW (DNG): the sensor\'s unprocessed data for e.g. Lightroom. In Photo and Pro, always 4:3. Filters and portrait do not apply to RAW. Other modes save JPEG.</string>
    <string name="format_desc_raw_jpeg">RAW + JPEG: a DNG file and a JPEG of every photo. Filters apply to the JPEG. In Photo and Pro, always 4:3.</string>
